lt value is 30 seconds.\r\nAs long as a connection is in the TIME_WAIT state, the socket pair\r\ncannot be re-used, BUT bind() still returns 0 in this case.\r\ncurl now can detect the state of a given port using\r\nGetTcpTable2() for IPv4 connections and avoids to bind that port\r\nif the state is TIME_WAIT\r\n\r\nref: https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/troubleshoot/windows-client/networking/tcpip-and-nbt-configuration-parameters#optional-tcpip-parameters-that-you-can-configure-by-using-registry-editor\r\n\r\nFixes: https://github.com/curl/curl/issues/8112\r\nReported-by: gclinch on github","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/8528/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/8528/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/comments/3017320851","html_url":"https://github.com/curl/curl/issues/8112#issuecomment-3017320851","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/8112","id":3017320851,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAiu0c6z2KmT","user":{"login":"pseusys","id":22302418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzAyNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22302418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pseusys","html_url":"https://github.com/pseusys","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pseusys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pseusys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pseusys/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pseusys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pseusys/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pseusys/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pseusys/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pseusys/events{/privacy}","received_